{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06720","headline":"塞下曲四首 一 · 王昌龄","name":"塞下曲四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉鸣空桑林，八月萧关道。\n出塞入塞寒，处处黄芦草。\n从来幽幷客，皆共尘沙老。\n莫学游侠儿，矜夸紫骝好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「塞下曲四首」条，撰者方　牧、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"方 牧"}